&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;原文链接: &lt;a href="https://doc.rust-lang.org/rustdoc/read-documentation/search.html"&gt;https://doc.rust-lang.org/rustdoc/read-documentation/search.html&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
